window.products.push({"id":247144,"name":"Wide Mouth Mason Jars 16 oz. (4 Pack) - Pint Size Jars with Airtight Lids and Bands for Canning, Fermenting, Pickling, or DIY Decors and Projects - Bu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l4mSGy40L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"BALL WIDE MOUTH MASON JARS Ball Mason Jars give you well-preserved food with long-lasting freshness for up to 18 months! They boast maximum capability in preserving high-acid foods like salsas, pickles, and fruits, as well as low-acid foods such as meats and more. CANNING WITH OUR BALL JARS Canning keeps your homemade preserves not just fresh but 100% safe. With the right techniques andprocesses, your food will not leach any chemicals that can cause spoiling.Thus, it extends your food’s shelf life without the need for refrigeration. BALL MASON JARS - AN ALL-AROUND GLASS CONTAINER Our Jars are USDA approved and microwave safe-making them ideal for water bath canning, fermenting, preserving, and pickling fruits and vegetables. It is also great to use as a cookie jar or keeping your condiments, sweets, jams, drinks, and more. They also make a beautiful organizer for arts and crafts supplies, offices supplies, and a vase for fresh or faux flowers. WIDE MOUTH AND MEASURE MARKS Our Mason Jars are designed with a wide mouth to make it easier to fill and empty – perfect for bulky stuff like cucumbers or lemons. The wide opening also allows easy cleaning – ensuring that your glass is always hygienic and good to reuse. The embossed measurements provide accurate filling. The Jar also doubles as a measuring cup for cooking and baking. AIRTIGHT SEAL It is constructed with a 2-piece lid and band that tightly seals the jar to prevent any air from entering.Store them at room temperature for up to 18 months. GET A FREE JAR OPENER Having a hard time opening your jar or unsure you sealedthe lid tight enough? In your package, you'll find a jar opener that will allow you toopen the jars with ease, and at the same time, ensure a tight seal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l4mSGy40L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peaknip","source_asin":"B0C59NYS6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C59NYS6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C59NYS6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
