window.products.push({"id":247160,"name":"Zen Candle Set 3 Pack Soy Candle Set with Healing Crystals and Flowers Gift for Birthday, Anniversary, Mother's Day and Many More Occasions","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lpuoYm3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This one-of-a-kind crystal and dried flower candle set of 3 comes beautifully packaged, ready for any special occasion. Each candle has been carefully designed with a refreshing and unique fragrance that compliments the stones & dried flowers, and enhances their natural energy- releasing good vibes and a beautiful scent. They can also be used for relaxation, meditation, stress relief, and home decor.WEIGHT: Total weight is approx. 25 OZ Each votive candle holds 5oz (120g) of pure soy wax. BURN TIME: Each crystal candle has an approx. burn time of 25-30 hours, for a total of up to 90hours. CANDLE SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS: 1. Never leave a burning candle unattended 2. Ensure wicks are upright and trimmed to 1/4” each time candle is lit 3. Always burn candles on a protected, heat-resistant surface 4. Avoid using near drafts and flammable materials 5. Keep out of reach of children and pets 6. Do not burn for more than 4 hours at a time 7. Do not burn when there is 1/4” wax remaining 8. Do not attempt to remove crystals while candle is lit","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lpuoYm3WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zen Candles by Nina","source_asin":"B09QJ78TYW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QJ78TYW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QJ78TYW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":247161,"name":"Peugeot Elis 4 Piece Wine Service Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mz8CsuUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For more than a century, the Peugeot name has been synonymous with French gourmet cooking. Peugeot recently brought its penchant for quality and innovation to a family of wine products. Since then, Peugeot has offered a wide range of corkscrews, specialized decanters, tasting glasses and service accessories to wine aficionados worldwide. Peugeot's Wine Service Kit includes a rechargeable electric wine corkscrew, one foil cutter and two pouring spouts. Peugeot's Elis rechargeable electric wine corkscrew represents the height of Peugeot quality and innovation. Developed in-house and produced exclusively by Peugeot, it is less bulky than other electric corkscrews and fits all bottle necks. It can uncork a bottle effortlessly in a few seconds and works well with corks of all types, even the harder synthetic ones. Unlike most other electric corkscrews, the screw (worm) can be replaced (replacement worm sold separately). The rechargeable battery pack eliminates the waste and cost of replacement batteries. Peugeot's Elis corkscrew is made of stainless steel and polycarbonate and comes complete with the charging unit. The Jero wine foil cutter makes short, easy work of even the most troublesome bottle foils. Its innovative design allows the foil to be removed from any size still wine bottle with minimal effort. Just press Jero over the bottle top, give it little more than a quarter turn, and Voila. the foil is cut. There is no easier or safer way to remove a foil top from a wine bottle. The Arros wine bottle spouts feature a drip-saving design. Not only does the Arros spout catch and prevent drips, its slotted collar directs any drips right back into the bottle. The simple, compact design of the Arros Spout makes it easy to pour wine from a bottle into glasses or a decanter. The pouring spout fits snugly into standard wine bottles, and will not fall out or slip during pouring. To clean Arros spouts, rinse with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mz8CsuUqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peugeot","source_asin":"B00440CY4M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00440CY4M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00440CY4M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
