window.products.push({"id":247351,"name":"Homyux 24x35 inch Chenille Bathroom Rugs Large Shag Bath Mat, Extra Soft and Absorbent,1500GSM Ultra Thickness, Machine Washable with Non-Slip Backing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z4yjiJ5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chenille ATTRACTIVE SOFTNESS: Compare the normal quality, this plush chenille oversize rug is more larger(24 inches wide x 35 inches long ), also it is more thick and bushy, quality up to 1500 GSM weight, The rug is made up of thousands of individual microfibers. each microfiber pile is about 1\" long, Many colors are optional(Gray/Purple/Pink/Red/Black/White/etc). GREAT ABSORBENCY: The chenille bath rug can absorb water quickly, it has strong water-absorbent ability because we use environmentally-friendly materials, double the moisture-absorbing fibers, neat and beautiful edging, so that the bathroom is no longer wet, perfect for displaying high-quality mats. NON-SLIP BACKING: It is healthier than ordinary rubber backing. But its anti-skid effect is as good as the rubber ones. Preventing you from slipping when coming out the bathroom. Non-slip and environmental bathroom rug should be your first choice to protect your health and your family. MANY OCCASIONS: They fit in whatever interior decor you have in your space, it is not restricted to your home bathroom or toilet, it works well in your vacation home, bedroom, shower, floor, kitchen, poolside, or beauty care business, hotel and even for your pets. EASY CARE: Machine washable. Since this chenille rug is so shaggy and large, so we had to ship them in vacuum-bag. After you receive it, you need to taking it out of the vacuum bag, fluff it up, slightly reshape it, this rug will match any bathroom decor perfectly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z4yjiJ5lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homyux","source_asin":"B07GF3334C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247351","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GF3334C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GF3334C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
