window.products.push({"id":247574,"name":"Cozyhealth Lumbar Support Pillow for Sleeping, Heated Lumbar Pillow with Graphene Heating for Lower Back Pain Relief, Memory Foam Lower Back Support P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7182N35UL6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【 Heated Lumbar Support Pillow 】 We added heat function on the basis of ordinary lumbar pillow. Lumbar pillow follows the natural arch of the lower back, providing comfort and support for the lumbar and help improve wrong posture. Combined with graphene heating therapy, it relieves waist pain, sciatic nerve and scoliosis, and keeps your hip and spine in ideal alignment while sleeping. (NOT USING the heating function while sleeping.) 【 Ergonomic Lumbar Pillow 】 The wrapped two-wing design to help improve spine posture, prevent the strain of lumbar muscles and make the lumbar spine stretch, perfect for relieving lumbar pressure evenly keep the waist curve. The waist support pillow fills the gap between the waist and bed, gently supports the lower back, and distributes the pressure to reduce the burden on the lower back, relax the muscles of the lower back and waist. Help achieve an ideal posture and a fit to the waist. 【 Thermal Therapy 】 When you choose to use USB heating function, heated lumbar pillow help blood circulation, and relieve lower back pain, sciatic nerve. 9 convex points are designed to help take care of the lumbar spine. The USB heating lumbar pillow has 3 adjustable temperatures and 3 hours automatic shutdown function, provide you with comfortable temperature to meet the heating requirements of most customers. 【 Premium Memory Foam 】 Inner material is made with 100% premium quality high density memory foam, which can retain its shape for continued support With breathable and moisture-wicking properties, comfortable back lumbar pillow provides long-lasting comfort for hours. Superior to other bed positioned pillows, it won't go flat over time and provides moderate support and spinal alignment. Our lumbar bed pillow comes with hypoallergenic, removable zipper breathable pillowcase, easy cleaning. 【 Widely Application 】 This lower back pillow lumbar support cushion not only relieve your lower back Pain while adapting to the curve of your spine when sleeping on your lower back, but also can be placed in the calf or below the knee as a leg pillow. Waist pillows apply for bed, chair, sofa, you can relax your waist and relieve waist fatigue at home, in the office and in the car at any time. Suit for side sleeper, back sleeper, stomach sleeper, Long time driver, desk workers. * Regarding the USB heating function, this product can't be recharged, it can only keep the USB cable connected to the power supply to use the heating function, there is no plug or power supply in the package, only one USB cable with controller. When using, you need to plug the USB cable into the power bank, PC or USB adapter (5V=1A charger/DC USB input). Do not use the heating function in a closed space without heat dissipation, such as a bed quilt, to avoid burns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7182N35UL6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozyhealth","source_asin":"B09J7RT2TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J7RT2TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J7RT2TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
