window.products.push({"id":247700,"name":"Riedel Vinum Cuve Prestige Glass, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":75.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Zz18DdF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cuvée Prestige glass is perfect for highlighting the bouquet of champagne while encouraging the bead. The magic of this well-balanced glass is that it accentuates the complexity and richness of vintage champagnes and prestige cuvées, highlighting the full spectrum of aromas and flavors. Thanks to the small agitative dot at the base of each bowl, it can also preserve their effervescence.Vinum is RIEDEL's basic varietal specific stemmed series. Designed in 1986 by 10th generation glassmaker Georg J. Riedel, Vinum was created to ensure every wine lover could afford varietal-specific glassware. Based on the handmade Sommeliers range, machine production means Vinum can be offered at a more accessible price.Premium machine-made and dishwasher safe.“PREMIUM” defines the advantage of a machine blown RIEDEL glass vs. A hand-made glass. The difference lies within the precision. Since RIEDEL glasses are fine-tuned instruments that support your wine enjoyment, we must make sure that there are no variances in the execution of the bowl and rim diameter, which is the key to our philosophy!This pack contains 2 pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Zz18DdF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Riedel","source_asin":"B00E93N2TU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E93N2TU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E93N2TU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
