window.products.push({"id":247712,"name":"Art Studio Company Hand Painted Glass Christmas Ornament - Garden of The Gods","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I-hXILnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Garden of the Gods in Colorado like you’ve never seen it before. This beautiful, reverse-painted glass ornament displays red rocks and mountains in full 360 degrees. It continues an ancient art-form prized by collectors. The artists choosing from a selection of miniature curved and bent-shafted brushes, painstakingly hand paints every minute detail on the inside of the ornament. The craft requires the artists to repeatedly insert the brush through the small opening in the sphere; first to outline the design, and then to detail the colors one by one. The entire process for each ornament requires up to two days. No two pieces are identical, making this inside-painted glass ornament a keepsake to be treasured from generation to generation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I-hXILnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Art Studio Company","source_asin":"B07KRY85PG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KRY85PG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KRY85PG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":247713,"name":"Small Artificial Plants in Pots for Home Decor Fake Faux Feaux Face Decorative Plant Decoration Arrangements Mini Artificial Potted Plants Greenery De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hB6oKgZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After killing more plants than weÕd like to admit, we wanted to help other folks with Òbrown thumbsÓ enjoy the benefits and beauty of indoor plants without the hassle of constant upkeep. With our artificial bamboo leaves potted plant, youÕll never have to worry about overwatering or underwatering. No need for the right amount of sunlight or fertilizer, no invasive insects, pruning or any of the other annoying maintenance needs that come with live plants.Not only will you save money in the long run on things like soil, fertilizer, and your water bill, but youÕll never have to deal with the frustration of killing another plant, again!Have a rambunctious pet thatÕs always knocking things over in excitement? Fake plants are a must. No more worrying about expensive pots breaking or muddy dirt and water all over the floor! ÒCan I put these faux plants in water?Ó No. The paper mache pot base is thick but not waterproof, so your potted plants should NEVER be put in water. ÒHow big are these?Ó Each plant is about nine inches tall by eight inches wide, so theyÕre about the size of a water bottle. In need of some decoration inspiration? Our fake plant decorations are a great way to spruce up: _ Kitchen counters_ Window and hallway shelves_ Bathrooms_ Office desks_ Entertainment centers_ Nightstands_ Dorm rooms_ Apartments WhatÕs Included: 1x Artificial potted bamboo leafs plant (8.5Ó - 9Ó H x 7.5Ó - 8Ó W) No More Letting Your ÒBrown ThumbÓ Embarrass You Order your SophiaÕs Garden artificial succulents, tree foliage, grass balls, or lucky clover sets now and never kill another plant or deal with the constant maintenance hassle of keeping live shrubs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hB6oKgZJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophia's Garden","source_asin":"B08BNK2B87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BNK2B87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BNK2B87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
