window.products.push({"id":247981,"name":"Winlyn 4 Pcs St. Patrick's Day Tinsel Decorations Green Foil Tinsel Shamrock Lucky Four-Leaf Clover Leprechaun Hat Wreaths and Shamrock Wired Garland ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918Frq69sXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quantity: Package includes 1 Pc Tinsel Shamrock St. Patrick's Day Wreath, 1 Pc Lucky Four-Leaf Clover Tinsel Wreath, 1 Pc Tinsel Leprechaun Hat Decoration, 1 Pc 25' long Shamrock Tinsel Wire Garland, and 4 Pcs Adhesive Wall Hooks. Each foil St. Patrick's Day wreath has a small loop attached to the top for convenient hanging. St. Patrick's Day party guests will feel lucky when they see a dazzling good luck clover tinsel wreath hanging on the front door. Color: St. Patrick's Day hanging decorations are Irish green and feature shapes of shamrock, lucky four-leaf clover, and leprechaun hat. The clover wreaths have cute heart-shaped leaves. The foil garland comes coiled and is covered in small and big, green lucky clover cutouts. Brimming with Irish cheer, these tinsel St. Patrick's Day wall decorations could be a great addition to your holiday decoration, lending festive charm to doorway or wall of your home, office or classroom. Size: These lucky St. Patrick's Day wreath decorations measure about 11.8\" in diameter depending on the shapes. Ideal size for hanging on your front door, wall, window, or mantel for a festive display. The foil shamrock wire garland measures about 25' long, which is long enough for your St. Patrick's Day or Ireland themed projects, such as trimming trees, making wreaths, or embellishing gift packages. Material: The tinsel shamrock and 4-leaf clover wreaths are made of bendable wire bases and covered with green tinsel, so you can shape them to the perfect look. The tinsel leprechaun hat wreath is made with green and black tinsel wrapped around a lightweight plastic frame and accented with a gold buckle cutout. The tinsel wire garland can be straightened out and cut for your DIY projects. These St. Patty's Day decorations can be used both indoor or outdoor and are easily stored for future use. The luck of the Irish will shine on your decor with these foil tinsel St. Patrick's Day wreaths and garland! Hang the lucky shamrock wreath on the front door, wall, mantel, window, or anywhere it fits to set the scene for St. Patrick's Day. Create a unique table centerpiece or use them to adorn your entrance table as part of a snazzy St. Patty's Day display. They are perfect for St. Patrick's Day or Ireland themed parties, celebrations, classroom, office, wedding, or retail display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/918Frq69sXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Winlyn","source_asin":"B0BD1ZPH1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-247981","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD1ZPH1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD1ZPH1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
